ttempting to directly quantify the probability of something happening, it's easier to consider the probability of something not happening (and subtracting from 1).   This can serve to (re)conceptualizes conditions in an intuitive way and helps psycho-emotionally recalibrate. \r\n\r\nIn other words, if you find yourself having an emotional reaction to crypto price action, try a simple re-framing ... \r\n\r\nHow realistic is it that markets will simply rise linearly with no chop and no drawdowns, always & forever?\r\n\r\n#1 .. but for speculative 80 vol assets!?\r\n\r\nIn the context of our process, the RiskRange = immediate-term weather for the day.  The TREND = the season (or the climate). We tactically risk manage the weather (sell TRR/buy LRR) but don’t flip bias until the season changes (ie the TREND flips to/from BULLISH/BEARISH)\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n(VIEW LARGER IMAGE <https://model2.hedgeye.com/click/38136087.562/aHR0cHM6Ly9kMXloaWxzNml3aDVsNS5jbG91ZGZyb250Lm5ldC9jaGFydHMvcmVzaXplZC8xMzU3NDkvb3JpZ2luYWwvQ1ExLnBuZz9zcmM9ZW1haWwmZW1haWw9dGltc21pdGhhdmlhdGlvbkBnbWFpbC5jb20/5cbdd6b62ddf9c0a4d20e4e0C60035d57>)\r\n\r\n(VIEW LARGER IMAGE <https://model2.hedgeye.com/click/38136087.562/aHR0cHM6Ly9kMXloaWxzNml3aDVsNS5jbG91ZGZyb250Lm5ldC9jaGFydHMvcmVzaXplZC8xMzU3NDkvb3JpZ2luYWwvQ1EyLnBuZz9zcmM9ZW1haWwmZW1haWw9dGltc21pdGhhdmlhdGlvbkBnbWFpbC5jb20/5cbdd6b62ddf9c0a4d20e4e0Ce6aab91f>)\r\n\r\n(VIEW LARGER IMAGE <https://model2.hedgeye.com/click/38136087.562/aHR0cHM6Ly9kMXloaWxzNml3aDVsNS5jbG91ZGZyb250Lm5ldC9jaGFydHMvcmVzaXplZC8xMzU3NDkvb3JpZ2luYWwvQ1EzLnBuZz9zcmM9ZW1haWwmZW1haWw9dGltc21pdGhhdmlhdGlvbkBnbWFpbC5jb20/5cbdd6b62ddf9c0a4d20e4e0C6079dfc8>)\r\n\r\n(VIEW LARGER IMAGE <https://model2.hedgeye.com/click/38136087.562/aHR0cHM6Ly9kMXloaWxzNml3aDVsNS5jbG91ZGZyb250Lm5ldC9jaGFydHMvcmVzaXplZC8xMzU3NDkvb3JpZ2luYWwvRXhpdF9Qcm9jZXNzLnBuZz9zcmM9ZW1haWwmZW1haWw9dGltc21pdGhhdmlhdGlvbkBnbWFpbC5jb20/5cbdd6b62ddf9c0a4d20e4e0C4b47f361>)\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n*With